# WHAT IS DELIBERATELY TRACKED, so that a later edit has to argue with a
# sentence before it can drop it:
#
#   results/*.json   THE EVIDENCE. Every number in README.md is derived from
#                    these by scripts/check_readme_numbers.py, and the test
#                    suite asserts against them.
#   sim/, connector/ the simulation and the connector under test
#   scripts/         the four experiments and the figure checker
#
# THERE IS NO GENERATED DATA DIRECTORY. The world is a pure function of the
# seed and is built in memory; every results file carries the manifest sha256
# of the world it was measured on, so a reader who re-runs can prove they hold
# the same input rather than take it on trust.
#
# Excluded below is only what a clone can rebuild.

envs
.venv
__pycache__
.pytest_cache
*.pyc
.DS_Store
